      <w:r>
        <w:t>This is how ARIA will be structured. The User interface will be a Web Dashboard, maybe in the future I will developpe an application. The application will be running on a NAS in a container. And to conclude with this diagram ARIA will get all the information she needs in the API corresponding to the device.</w:t>
